# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Cayth grants Fabricate 1 to another nontoken creature as it enters.
# Forcing: Grizzly Bears is the only spell; Cayth is the only Fabricate source on the battlefield.
# AI behavior: No opposing hand or board decisions compete with resolution.
# Failure modes: A prompt without the counter-or-Servo outcomes, a wrong outcome, or stale priority fails the flow.
# Card roles: Cayth grants Fabricate; Grizzly Bears enters; two Forests pay; Forest in hand proves continued play.
# Protocol path: Fabricate trigger on the stack, OptionalActionMessage naming it, counter or Servo, fresh legal actions.
[metadata]
